    "en": "A crystal has L = 3 H, C = 0.05 pF and mounting capacitance Cm = 10 pF. Find fs and fp."
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "en": "LC = 3 × 0.05 × 10⁻¹² = 1.5 × 10⁻¹³ s²."
    },
