     "en": "fs = 1/(2π√(1.5 × 10⁻¹³)) = 410.9 kHz."
    },
    {
     "en": "fp = fs√(1 + C/Cm) = fs × √1.005 = 412.0 kHz."
    },
    {
     "en": "The two differ by only about 1026 Hz (0.25%)."
    }
   ],
